Presidential elections were held in [[Senegal]] on 21 February 1993. Incumbent president [[Abdou Diouf]] of the [[Socialist Party of Senegal|Socialist Party]] defeated seven other candidates, receiving 58% of the vote. Voter turnout was 51%.<ref name=AED>[http://africanelections.tripod.com/sn.html Elections in Senegal] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180831074737/http://africanelections.tripod.com/sn.html |date=2018-08-31 }} African Elections Database</ref>

